00:11:26.603 --> 00:11:49.923
So in a certain sense, when I pick the cards and I look at the cards and I get a reaction to the cards, like I get associations, I get images, I make connections to my own life. It's not so much about the card. It could be about a lot of things, but first and foremost, it's about my reaction to the card.

00:11:50.199 --> 00:12:11.193
