00:12:27.132 --> 00:12:47.690
Projection is an unconscious automatic process whereby a content that is unconscious to the subject transfers itself to an object so that it seems to belong to that object. And he says that's a very normal thing. Projections are completely normal. Everyone has projections. That's actually a way how we learn about ourselves.

00:12:49.672 --> 00:13:10.129
