00:13:35.121 --> 00:13:50.770
It's another thing to see there Scorpio or scales and all these other things. So this is then the question, okay, why do human beings see see that. And he sees a connection, a connection that's not necessarily only personal, saying like, oh, this is only your perception.

00:13:50.818 --> 00:14:05.410
This is only your, let's say, imagination, but rather, oh, we have this ancient part within ourselves and this is reacting to a lot of things and this is shaping a lot of our perceptions and ideas. And this is the archetypes that I will get into.

