And what it made click for me, at least for my approach and how I interact with Tarot and with what I wanted to talk about in this event is what a member of, of this meetup group told me and also shown me, which is this Internal Family Systems. It's a therapeutic approach where it's, it's super interesting.

00:14:29.565 --> 00:14:52.663
