00:16:55.482 --> 00:17:15.769
The cards, they're fitting so well. Yeah, they're fitting in a sense because they're fitting to your psychology. This would be the, the Jungian approach, but we will also talk about additional approach afterwards that it's not maybe so random what's happening there. So when we have the tarot cards.

00:17:16.925 --> 00:17:32.548
