Because it's very easy to get lost in the subjective. It's in a sense, situation happened to one's life, birth, death, tragedy. Luck that seem— one is the very first person to experience this. The first heartbreak, the first breakup, it feels like the end of the world.

00:20:05.142 --> 00:20:25.143
