00:21:20.787 --> 00:21:42.969
I cannot connect it to anything, which makes sense because the collective unconscious, so the really deep layer of our psyche, is impersonal. It's eternal. It's hundreds of thousands or millions of years old. It's not even unique to human beings. We have it also in animals. We have it in plants. We have their commonalities.

00:21:43.797 --> 00:21:54.837
And it can be completely removed from oneself and one's own life that it becomes overwhelming. And that way, he says, this can really break the psyche of people.

