Interestingly enough, when Jung started to formalize archetypes, and this was already pretty early ideas of his, early meaning late '30s, when, when he started to move on in this direction, this was one big part that convinced him to look deeper in the human psyche, that there are certain images coming up in a lot of cultures that are temporally and geographically very, very separated.

00:23:32.575 --> 00:23:54.343
