00:25:50.050 --> 00:26:13.708
So, but the thing that I find very, very interesting is when you draw a card or several cards, it's kind of a statement. It's a little bit similar when you're talking with someone and they bring up a topic because it's an outside perspective. It's something that is brought in and you have kind of integrate or make sense of and pay attention to.

00:26:14.638 --> 00:26:36.317
