00:32:09.199 --> 00:32:28.689
And very likely the things that one does not know and does not understand seem highly, highly, highly irrational. But at the same time, these are the things that help with the development and the changes and helping also to solve the problems of one's life. So this is what this quote is about from Jung.

00:32:29.966 --> 00:32:43.538
